 "codigo": "SV024",
 "parte": 1,
 "titulo": "Tower Six burned down in 1998. It called me tonight 📻 Part 1 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "IT BURNED IN 1998",
 "descripcion": "Cal watches the forest for smoke from Tower Nine. The list by the window has three rules. The third one says never answer Tower Six.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you answer?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "My job is to sit alone in a tower and watch for smoke.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Forty days at a time, sixty feet above the forest.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I'm Cal, thirty-four, fire lookout at Tower Nine.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "My only company is the radio, and a list taped by the window.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The man before me wrote it. Three rules.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Log every light. Answer every radio check. Never answer Tower Six.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I laughed at the last one. Tower Six burned down in 1998.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Its channel was taken off the radio years ago.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "On my twelfth night, at 2:47 in the morning, the radio clicked.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "Tower Nine, this is Tower Six. Radio check.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "A calm voice. Old. Very polite.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I didn't answer. I wrote it in the log, like the rules said.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then I looked east, where Tower Six used to stand.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "On top of the ridge, there was a lantern. In a window that doesn't exist anymore.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It blinked three times, like it knew I was watching.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I kept my hand far away from the radio.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then Tower Six spoke again. Cal, you can see me, can't you?",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
